+/** Cost optimization over a naive AddOtherCheck/AddResult split (both would
+ * independently re-run the SAME `Other extends number ? ... : Other extends
+ * NDArray<infer B, infer Dd> ? ...` dispatch and the SAME `Broadcast`/
+ * `Promote` computation once for the parameter check and once again for the
+ * return type — TS 7's instantiation cache is keyed by (alias, type
+ * arguments), so calling this ONE alias with IDENTICAL arguments from both
+ * consumers below lets the cache serve the second call instead of
+ * recomputing): one shared conditional computes BOTH the check type and the
+ * result type together, keyed by the same three-way `Other` dispatch
+ * `AddOtherCheck`'s own doc comment above describes in full. */
+type AddCore<D extends DType, S extends Shape, Other> = IsUnion<Other> extends true
+  ? { readonly check: Guard<ShapeError<AddUnionMessage>, never>; readonly result: NDArray<Shape, DType> }
+  : Other extends number
+    ? { readonly check: ScalarOperand<D, Other>; readonly result: NDArray<S, D> }
+    : Other extends NDArray<infer B extends Shape, infer Dd extends DType>
+      ? {
